{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Demetrius is generally going to be the hardest to do things with or see as he spends most of his time making sure ferrytown doesn't metaphysically tear apart, but he can be found occasionally. Pirrame, a member of the court none of you have net before this intermission, is out and about a lot more recently, likely due to rising tensions.","created_at":"2021-08-01T06:54:29.276000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"871284738206351401","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Secel makes her way to where she laid down before and drops to her knees. Grabbing hold of her necklace, she begins to pray. \n\n“Athena, daughter of Zues and Metis, queen of wisdom, warrior of the heavens above, I pray for your forgiveness. Last night, I gave in. Gave in to my hate, my rage, my Infernal blood. I felt the corruption coming closer, and…” she trails off, then starts again. “I wish to right my wickedness. I pray I have not fallen from your blessings, and that I am able to return to you if I have.” She paused again, taking in a deep breath. “I would also wish that… that if I am too far gone, that…” She choked on the words. She then sighed. “I am sorry..”\n\nShe then laid on her back, pulling off the hat and setting it on her chest as she looked at the stars…","created_at":"2021-08-01T07:24:20.851000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"871292252616556564","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
